Why This Happened

Your query showed:

Plain Text
host_names: ['localhost']

So ClickHouse only trusted local connections.

Langfuse connects from a different Docker container, therefore authentication failed even though the username existed.

This is the final major blocker. After allowing network access and setting a matching password (default), Langfuse should start successfully.
